sequenceDiagram
autonumber
participant R as replay()
participant C as correlation()
participant D as CorrelationDetector
R->>C: target series then selected peer series
alt fewer than two series
    C-->>R: status=skipped
else at least two series
    loop each target-left unordered pair
    Note over C: common = sorted exact timestamp intersection, no interpolation
    C->>D: fresh instance for this pair
    loop each common timestamp
        C->>D: update([left_value, right_value])
        alt adaptive mode (default)
            Note over D: Buffer alignment_tolerance points
            opt enough lookahead
                D->>D: _update_adaptive(target, future)
                Note over D: Compare prior relation, score before gated learning
            end
            D-->>C: CorrelationResult(score_index, observed_index, ready)
        else fixed reference mode
            Note over D: Learn reference, then score disjoint local windows
            D-->>C: CorrelationResult(score, ready)
        end
        Note over C: Write ready score at score_index, else current index
    end
    Note over C: Unready and trailing pending positions remain None
    end
    C-->>R: pair outputs, common times, ready_points, sources
end
